sequenceDiagram
  participant U as user
  participant N as Nova API
  participant C as Cinder
  participant R as Ceph RBD
  participant H as nova-compute
  U->>N: server create --boot-from-volume
  N->>C: create a volume from the image
  C->>R: rbd clone images/img@snap volumes/vol
  R-->>C: ready (a few seconds)
  N->>H: schedule the VM
  H->>C: connection info (rbd, pool, user)
  H->>H: libvirt XML with a network/rbd disk
  H->>R: QEMU opens it with librbd
